{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-10_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-10","title":"长夜终尽","storyCode":"5-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"901fc5f3589b31b96410f03ba474adb4ccb15ee06a7ae45f7bf302897998f951","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"赤霄终于出鞘，天平又一次倒向近卫局一方。\n然而一时的杂念却引得赤霄失控，危急时刻，罗德岛终于赶到。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你要出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只要在这里杀死我，这里的所有整合运动都会因此崩溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你拒绝和我对话，那真的很不幸。请吧，杀死我，如果你做得到的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人的攻势非常猛烈！我们要速战速决，不能再拖了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"两方的指挥官只有一个能活下来，非常简单明了的局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我的遗言不会太长，长官。只要你能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得你是什么，殉道者吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你死后没人会纪念你。受死和受尊重是两回事，这取决于你的所作所为，而不是死法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然想和有价值的敌人博弈，然后有价值地死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你是没法帮我达成愿望了。你会一败涂地，长官。现在轮到我来指出你的处境了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的自信建立在切尔诺伯格的陨落之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里不是切尔诺伯格，不是乌萨斯人无情的恶土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"强韧的龙门不会在你这种小卒手中陷落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"说得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【咆哮】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"斩击？不，不可能！这难道是......法术？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"向后退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎么会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【痛苦的呻吟】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"别害怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不会痛的，不要害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【呻吟】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（太远了。想再向前挪步又相当困难，消耗战对我不利。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"真是强大的技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你的法术提前触爆了浮士德的攻击，甚至洞穿了我布设的阵型，划痕从第一位护卫颈间一直蔓延到我面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"再让你上前几步，我一定会被你撕成两段。就连浮士德也没法阻止你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次你就没这么幸运了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，你无能为力。你的秘密已经曝光了，长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"拙劣的戏法一般只表演一次，因为表演完毕后，它们不会剩下什么秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间的距离超出了你法术的范围，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"天台只有这点大小。你没几步可退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可你又能向前几步呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，让她见识一下什么叫真正的魔术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的位置我一清二楚。暴露了的狙击手是没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"真厉害啊，陈长官。无论是什么弩弹你都能切碎吗？而我和刚才一样，根本什么都没看清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击手，我同时遭到了来自你和三点钟方向的狙击，但那个方向没有任何敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不可能是那种术师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不用费尽心思去猜了，长官，你猜不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，你能截住几发弩弹？十发？四十发？百发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，碎片呢？冲击呢？弩弹里蕴含的源石技艺呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"难道这些你也能全部截住吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"废话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_chen_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_chen_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_chen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我知道你是什么。我的源石技艺只对感染者有效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你只会成为他们的棋子，然后被他们随手丢弃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话，我原封不动地还给你。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会给你机会，龙门却不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，我们可能要被迫向下转移了！敌人的攻势太猛烈了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘁，一旦我想要移动，弩弹就会从四面八方射来，敌人的狙击手究竟是怎么做到的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（半寸出鞘仅仅只能清扫狙击手的攻击，但再这样消耗下去，我迟早气短力尽。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（我必须在一瞬间里分出胜负......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你还想说些什么，我都没时间再听下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（红色在她身边凝聚，这是施术的前兆。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"（梅菲斯特，按照计划，现在射击她，她必须中断施术，或者，她 会在爆炸中死去。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可这难道不是挫去她锐气的最好机会吗？先等等，你就好好看着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会错失良机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"战略的目标比战术更重要，浮士德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和我一起走！别再留在这里了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不想离开这里吗，离这些人、这个地方远远的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是不知道？大人们那么对待你和我，全都怪他！全都是他的错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我恨这座城市。我恨他。别让我也恨你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——拔刀！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_chen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"所有护卫，并行！挡住她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"【尖啸】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，不行！赤霄失控了？怎么偏偏在这时候！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"法术凝滞了。她没能成功施术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"命令，射击。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶......散出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"真是把强大的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是溢散的法术，竟然能把所有箭矢弩弹一扫而空，甚至还剥夺了三个护卫的行动能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也被冲击击中了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（一根，不，两根肋骨？还能忍住。但这样强劲的火力和来源，我根本......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"就和领袖说的一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，你不是不想杀死我，你是没法拔出那把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你再说一遍，是谁，说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那个名字的，陈长官。这把剑，就像你说的，不是用来对抗我的，你的冲动损坏了它的运作方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们抓住你完全缺乏防备的那刻，你已经化成齑粉了。她完全知晓你的弱点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"花言巧语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要摧毁这片大地现在的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"若放任腐败继续滋长，整片大地都会陷落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只有摧毁这一切，无数锈蚀的城市才能打破枷锁，甚至是重生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_014","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶嚎）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"碍事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_moph"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，陈长官。你对龙门也很失望吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们的领袖在等你。何况你并没有为龙门服务的立场吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我有职责在身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那和立场无关。你所说的都是些世俗杂务，你知道他们是怎么对待我们的同胞们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你给我一点示意，我就会立刻停手。来，加入我们，让我们为更伟大的目标服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啐。我能给你的就只有这口血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有你这种人在，整合运动会是在实践什么高尚理念？我不相信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这样啊。如果你不相信，那就算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以好好挣扎一下。我的护卫和他的弩弹会让你见证感染者真正的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你孤身一人，而我们既团结又强大，你死得其所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"烂掉的话可以留到你死后再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以强行催化那把剑上凝聚着的源石技艺。那会发生很可怕的事吧？你的命运由你自己决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你想死得像个英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，人死了什么都不会剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果杀掉你意味着我需要和你同归于尽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不值得，但我可以做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的之间的谈话结束了。再见，陈长官。浮士德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"命令，射——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用做到那步，陈长官！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_8_sky"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"直升机？不，这不像直升机，这......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"煌，跳吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注意落地姿势，别离开我的热流！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么？有人从上面跳下来了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“恐惧升腾，她终将盲目——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，罗德岛？从天上？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"这些黑色的线条......怎么回事，难道是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“——泪水干涸，她恸哭无声。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的护卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......呜！呜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？我的护卫怎么会发出这种悲鸣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，我的法术早就该磨灭了他们的情感啊，怎么回事，怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是你吗！！你！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的兔子！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我限制了他们的活动，不过一次也只能持续十几秒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，够我创造出安全区了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧，煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好大干一场了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"要落地了，屁股会有点疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接好我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"命令，射击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"别小看人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"——弩弹被风偏移了？难道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"划开屋顶，让其他的整合运动全掉下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，但你一定得稳住！这招我几个月也只能用一次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_boom"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_boom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局的顶楼被切出了巨大的裂痕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你们小心坍塌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？怎么做到的？发生了什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，大量的整合运动也一同掉到这层楼里了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，大家撑住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":true,"text":"你用不着那么快就赶着去死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这么关键的时刻，你在通讯频道里搞什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我的任务完成了，我来告诉你一声而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛有架很厉害的东西，靠那个，她们应该马上就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经到了。你的任务是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"接应罗德岛啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"安全落地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，放我下来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉陈长官，我们来晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"依照协议，现在是罗德岛支援你的时候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_aircraft"},{"type":"narration","text":"数分钟前\n04:21 A.M.  天气/多云\n龙门上城区，“坏家伙”号，近卫局大楼上空40米处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好了，到你们大显身手的时候了！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是在热情高涨个什么劲啊，她之前可是把阿米娅丢在废城不管，现在不正该让她好好尝尝孤立无援的滋味吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，别这样。Dr.{@nickname}是对的。我们必须先解决龙门的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，罗德岛迄今以来的所有付出都会白费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，如果是命令的话，我接受。"}]},{"label":"......去吧。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"但说实话，我并不想帮这个家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，我们不能让罗德岛三个月来的努力白白流失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"经济效益是吧，得了，我做就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事，等到龙门安全了再讨论也不迟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那到时候，我们可要捞很大一笔佣金才行！"}]},{"label":"看她那狼狈的样子。去帮帮她，阿米娅。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我们看起来可是比她还要破破烂烂啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好烦，我都没想到废城里的那个家伙居然那么嚣张，凯尔希根本没提醒过我啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等回罗德岛，我请你吃咖喱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"回去以后，我们就能好好休息了。但首先，我们要把这场战斗彻底结束掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"行，就这么定了，上吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么会在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须在这，梅菲斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星在干什么！那个家伙怎么回事，难道又昏死过去了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你这只兔子，你们罗德岛，不早该被冻死在切城了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不能死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只要这片大地上还有矿石病带来的灾难，我们的战斗就永无休止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是你这样的狂人还是感染者遭遇的不公，我们都会一个接一个铲除！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊小兔子，如果你的敌人是我，就杀了我吧！现在！杀掉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不。你不是我的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就杀掉你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你想光荣地死去，你不会得逞。我要消灭的只是你的仇恨和恶毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你会怎么样根本不关我的事。看看这些感染者。你的死不能带来任何东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会在你这样的人身上浪费情感，至少，不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你想彻底与整合运动为敌吗？你想尝尝感染者真正的愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者是不同的。霜星小姐和你没有任何相似之处，整合运动并不都是你这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"她和你说了什么？这个女人......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是弄错了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我才是那个能控制住各个城市的人，我才是能够控制住那些普通人的人！不是她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，如果需要有人去惩罚你和你的恶行，我义不容辞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，而且敌对什么的，我们不是早就敌对了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"从你们开始制造恐怖和惨剧的那一步开始，我们就已经是敌人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，请再撑一会儿。罗德岛的支援小队也在接近这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......战场很嘈杂，我没能听见作战计划，陈长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"请说吧，陈长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国有句古话，“擒贼先擒王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"意思是，想要消灭敌人，就先要抓住敌人的指挥官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小心点，他那些没有理智的手下，会不断地被他重新驱赶进战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可以的话，去帮他们从这种痛苦中解脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我明白。你和煌去战斗，我来指挥。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，我用法术摧毁敌人的阵型，你去逼退他们的攻势！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要给陈长官争取空间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"她是很强，但她真有那么强吗？直接拿下那两个小子？我觉得悬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信博士的指挥能帮她做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我要突袭敌方的指挥官。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"帮你打开通道对吧，没问题！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你需要一个擒下对方指挥官的契机。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么样，我相信你一次。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也可以相信你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"和龙门联手吗，罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"现在亲眼见到，我才感到这带给感染者的耻辱有多深重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"四个人就把你逼到这种地步，要说可耻，你才是该感到羞耻的那个吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特，我们会在这里掐断你的恶行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德！把这些人，全都，全都从我的面前清除！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战斗该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，下一场恶战才会开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"下令，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛，听我指挥。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"协助陈长官，夺回近卫局大楼！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["？？？","阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["诗怀雅","陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["诗怀雅"]}]}
